&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 的这个能长久存活：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/hcve82VQ9rmiQQWYLDywrMpUaxiAftju0BYgioKD2RrVagGxha4eW8H9lFF8YHvhOQplltAZeVRThGQG2iBEo8cRIrxGVW6p-p7TQHAMkWJJIRfUTTahfl5ocNFFi7zMFD5Nmz9WxBS4wmrCDJTbmFDWa57E9XHsbbNFzfI_BvAwYuObWmsZVTgJLPwK0z6GzOqv2FVtolRLQYtaSYN5pMzVRDqYrQHtycvguKzpH-EKRAnNVHZ0H8KAP0lnHvanNtMAZeMQWXdyzH2kRk_vMza4_omJT-7R1OKTov0Cwv6qi0B8IgkKdQc64pRZy16vo_1AoN8JKbQgGjoLSmFxKA.jpg" width="552" height="239" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 12:02:52 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>